
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>간호 술기 학습 | Nurse Mate</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .skills-header {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .skills-header h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .skills-header p {
            color: #829087;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e8eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(35, 70, 48, 0.07);
        }

        .skill-category {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #eaf4ee;
            color: #43866b;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .skill-card h3 {
            font-size: 19px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .skill-card p {
            color: #829087;
            font-size: 14px;
            min-height: 45px;
        }

        .skill-card a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #43866b;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .skills-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="dashboard">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <h2>Nurse Mate</h2>
            <p>간호학과 학생을 위한 실습 파트너</p>

            <nav>
    <a href="/">대시보드</a>
    <a href="/skills">간호 술기 학습</a>
    <a href="/clinical-logs">임상실습 기록</a>
    <a href="/checklist">학습 체크리스트</a>
    <a href="/practice-schedules">실습 일정 관리</a>
    <a href="/quiz">간호 퀴즈</a>
    <a href="/medical-terms">의학용어 사전</a>
    <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
</nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            <header>
                <div>
                    <h1>간호 술기 학습</h1>
                    <p>핵심 간호 술기를 확인하고 학습해 보세요.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <span><%= user.name %>님</span>
                    <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
                </div>
            </header>

            <section class="skills-header">
                <h2>기본간호 술기</h2>
                <p>현재 등록된 술기: <%= skills.length %>개</p>
            </section>

            <section class="skills-grid">
                <% skills.forEach(skill => { %>
                    <article class="skill-card">
                        <span class="skill-category">
                            <%= skill.category %>
                        </span>

                        <h3><%= skill.title %></h3>

                        <p><%= skill.description %></p>

                        <a href="/skills/<%= skill.id %>">
                            자세히 보기 →
                        </a>
                    </article>
                <% }) %>
            </section>

            <% if (skills.length === 0) { %>
                <p>등록된 간호 술기가 없습니다.</p>
            <% } %>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

